WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
This isn't Jim's spray.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.080
This incident for the guy who wants his gloves

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.520
to smell like pine trees and laundry detergent.

4
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:10.120
This is for the athlete whose gear actually gets used.

5
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.760
The guy who knows that sweat is part of the game.

6
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.960
The guy who doesn't want his bag entering the room

7
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.400
before he does.

8
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.120
Jock-Shocked was built to handle the funk.

9
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.560
Not just cover it up.

10
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.040
Built specifically for gear.
